      moral: { en: 'A CCP reduces settlement risk twice: it guarantees fulfilment and it nets positions so fewer, smaller payments move.', zh: 'CCP 用兩招減結算風險：保證履約，同淨額結算令轉賬次數同金額都少咗。' },
